"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, hitman_woa.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The Peacock folder will then be downloaded into the game's core folder. The Archipelago plugin will be inside the Peacock 'plugins' folder. If the 'Launch Installation after setup' toggle is enabled, 'PeacockPatcher.exe' and 'Start Server.cmd' will run (admin access will be required).",
